            "text": "For shoppers in Sydney looking for the best online lolly shops to send a birthday gift, several excellent options offer a variety of sweets, customisation, and convenient delivery across Australia, including same-day services in Sydney.\n\nHere are some top recommendations:\n\n*   **Mandy's Candy Gift Boxes** is a great choice for personalised presents, offering customisable lolly gift boxes where you can select lollies, wine, and soft drinks. All gift boxes come beautifully wrapped with an option for a free, personalised gift tag, and they provide free same-day delivery within Sydney.\n*   **Dessert Boxes (Candy Collection Boxes)** also offers customisable candy and lolly boxes, allowing you to have the recipient's name written on the box. They provide same-day delivery for Birthday Dessert Boxes in Sydney and Wollongong.\n*   **Sweet As** is another excellent option for birthday gifts, offering lolly and chocolate gift boxes and hampers. They boast same-day gift delivery and the ability to create custom hampers using premium Australian and international lollies and chocolates.\n*   **The Sweet Giftorium** features customised lolly gift hampers, grazing boxes, and a dedicated \"Birthday Box - Lollies & Candy\". They deliver across Australia.\n*   **Lollylicious** specialises in handcrafted chocolate and lolly bouquets, arrangements, and hampers, offering a unique alternative to traditional gifts. They use high-quality chocolates like Ferrero, Lindt, Cadbury, Nestle, and Mars, and deliver Australia-wide, including Sydney.\n*   **iCandy Sydney** provides unique lollies perfect for birthdays, with local delivery available in the Hills District of Sydney. For those outside this area, they offer Australia-wide shipping for their Pick & Mix Candy Boxes.\n*   **Lolly Kingdom** is highlighted as Australia's largest online pick & mix lolly store, with over 300 lolly options, including specific \"BIRTHDAY BOX – Pick n Mix 1kg\" and \"21ST BIRTHDAY LOLLY BOX\" options, shipped quickly to your door across Australia.\n*   **Lolly Warehouse** provides an extensive range of birthday lollies that can be delivered Australia-wide, including Sydney, making it a convenient \"one-stop-shop for all bulk confectionery needs.\"\n*   **The Lolli Shop** offers a wide collection of lollies, chocolates, and candy with fast delivery across Australia, making it suitable for gifts.\n*   **Lolly Wall Australia** presents lolly gift boxes as a \"perfect blend of sweetness and style,\" featuring a curated selection of colourful, flavour-packed treats in beautiful packaging, ideal for birthdays and other occasions.\n*   **Joys Delights** imports a diverse range of exciting candy from around the world, including America, England, Japan, and New Zealand, with delivery across Australia.\n*   **SweetsWorld** offers a vast selection of over 5000 items, including Australian classics and international imports, delivered to your door."
          }
        ],
